@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Категории
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Список транзакций
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Фильтр + пагинация
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=expense&limit=10&offset=0

### Одна транзакция
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1

### 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/999

### Создать
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 890,
  "categoryId": 4,
  "description": "Обед в столовой",
  "date": "2026-09-08"
}

### 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "gift",
  "amount": -10
}

### Обновить
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 5100,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "description": "Покупка в супермаркете (обновлено)",
  "date": "2026-09-02",
  "status": "completed"
}

### Удалить
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/3
